From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Takashi Nakayama <tnak@chromium.org>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 19:19:15 -0700
Subject: [M150-LTS] ServiceWorker: Add feature flag to disable Code Cache

This CL adds a new runtime enabled feature, `ServiceWorkerCodeCache` to
disable Code Caching for subresource requests through Service Workers.
The new feature is disabled by default.

Bug: 558367547, 546413288, 547815507, 558342353
Change-Id: I2a3b7fbf8c489eec00bce668abb3a7cf438d9f44
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8377021
Reviewed-by: Yoshisato Yanagisawa <yyanagisawa@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Shunya Shishido <sisidovski@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Takashi Nakayama <tnak@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1695233}
(cherry picked from commit c0b5e81749361a9c8a79990f2c721a16d141882c)

